DESCRIPTION: | Arena Wien - Dreiraum | Spanish Grease Tour  Hinter Kemo The Blaxican verbrigt sich kein Geringerer als Delinquent Habits’ MC David Thomas! www.facebook.com/kemotheblaxican  support: Koko Cappelle Koko Cappelle is a Vienna-based Latin American rapper whose multicultural roots and fiercely feminist\, decolonial edge have made her a standout force in the city’s freestyle and battle rap circuit. Her recorded work moves between personal history\, cultural commentary\, and the thrill of pure lyrical combat. Koko performs with the clarity and conviction of someone who knows exactly why her voice matters. https://www.instagram.com/kokocappelle/   Vorverkauf/Presale Arena Shop € 25 (+ € 2\,75 Fee) Abendkassa/Box Office tba. 
